       }
      ],
      "text": "Azathioprine:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " aminosalicylates (eg, sulfasalazine, mesalamine) inhibit TPMT in vitro, so combine with caution; ACE inhibitors have been reported to induce anemia and severe leukopenia; it may inhibit warfarin's anticoagulant effect."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "TPMT or NUDT15 deficiency may raise the risk of severe, life-threatening myelotoxicity with conventional doses; consider alternative therapy if homozygous deficient and reduced doses if heterozygous."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Tell patients about the malignancy risk (lymphoma and other cancers, particularly of the skin) and to limit sun and UV exposure; it can cause fetal harm, so avoid it in pregnancy whenever possible."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
